                                              ns1:EMMO_c7b62dd7_063a_4c2a_8504_42f7264ba83f """The proper part relation has the following pair-covering sub-relations:
- hasMembers xor hasPiece
- hasPortionPart xor hasGatheredPart
. hasItemPart xor hasScatteredPart"""@en .


