                                                                         "A/Cel" ;
                           ns1:EMMO_7f1dec83_d85e_4e1b_b7bd_c9442d4f5a64 "A/°C" ;
                           ns1:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 """A measure used to express how a current is subject to temperature. Originally used in Wien's Law to describe phenomena related to filaments. One use today is to express how a current generator derates with temperature.

