The execution of an algorithm."""@en ;
                                              skos:prefLabel "Procedure"@en ;
                                              ns1:EMMO_31252f35_c767_4b97_a877_1235076c3e13 "The set of established forms or methods of an organized body for accomplishing a certain task or tasks (Wiktionary)."@en ;
