                                              rdfs:label "Fusion"@en ;
                                              skos:example "An atom, a group of persons, a fluid."@en ;
                                              skos:prefLabel "Fusion"@en ;
                                              ns1:EMMO_31252f35_c767_4b97_a877_1235076c3e13 "A mereological fusion is any entity that is made up of two or more quantum entities, regardless of the fact that they are or not self-connected. It captures the idea of set, but excluding singletons."@en ;
                                              ns1:EMMO_70fe84ff_99b6_4206_a9fc_9a8931836d84 "The union of the CausalCluster and CausalStructure classes."@en ;
                                              ns1:EMMO_8a137e9f_579c_4e28_baca_e8980eb0c3db "EquivalentTo: CausalCluster or CausalStructure" ;
                                              ns1:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 "The class of individuals representing mereological fusions consisting of two or more quantum entities."@en .

