                                              rdfs:subClassOf ns1:EMMO_2b9cbfb5_dbd0_4a68_9c6f_acc41b40dd72 ;
                                              rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/emmo/disciplines/manufacturing#> ;
                                              rdfs:label "ProcessEngineeringProcess"@en ;
                                              skos:prefLabel "ProcessEngineeringProcess"@en ;
                                              ns1:EMMO_c7b62dd7_063a_4c2a_8504_42f7264ba83f """Deals with entities that have a undefined shape. Undefined means that the actual shape of the entity that is produced is not relevant for the definition of the process.
