                                              ns1:EMMO_8de5d5bf_db1c_40ac_b698_095ba3b18578 "For more details, see ISO 80000-9:2009, Annex C"@en ;
                                              ns1:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 """Number quantifying the acidic or the alkaline character of a solution, equal to the negative of the decimal logarithm of ion activity aH+ of the hydrogen cation H+
