                                              skos:prefLabel "Assemblying"@en ;
                                              ns1:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 "The act of connecting together the parts of something"@en ;
                                              ns1:EMMO_c7b62dd7_063a_4c2a_8504_42f7264ba83f "No loss or adds of parts by the components, nor merging. In assemblying parts are losing some of theirs movement degrees of freedom."@en .

