                          ns1:EMMO_7f1dec83_d85e_4e1b_b7bd_c9442d4f5a64 "rad/s²" ;
                          ns1:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 """Angular acceleration is the rate of change of angular velocity. In SI units, it is measured in radians per Square second (rad/s²), and is usually denoted by the Greek letter α.

