                                                                                  rdfs:label "FatigueTesting"@en ;
                                                                                  skos:prefLabel "FatigueTesting"@en ;
                                                                                  ns1:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 "Fatigue testing is a specialised form of mechanical testing that is performed by applying cyclic loading to a coupon or structure. These tests are used either to generate fatigue life and crack growth data, identify critical locations or demonstrate the safety of a structure that may be susceptible to fatigue."@en .


###  https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/characterisation-methodology/chameo#FibDic
