                                                                                rdfs:label "Profilometry"@en ;
                                                                                skos:prefLabel "Profilometry"@en ;
                                                                                ns1:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 "Profilometry is a technique used to extract topographical data from a surface. This can be a single point, a line scan or even a full three dimensional scan. The purpose of profilometry is to get surface morphology, step heights and surface roughness."@en .


