###  https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/characterisation-methodology/chameo#PulsedElectroacousticMethod
<https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/characterisation-methodology/chameo#PulsedElectroacousticMethod> rdf:type owl:Class ;
