                                                       ns1:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 "unstable condition arising during constant voltage charge in which the rate of heat dissipation capability, causing a continuous temperature increase with resulting further charge current increase, which can lead to the destruction of the battery"@en ;
