                                                       skos:prefLabel "InitialCoulombicEfficiency"@en ;
                                                       skos:scopeNote "Often used in lithium-ion cell characterisation; especially significant for graphite, silicon, and other anode materials that form an SEI layer on the first cycle."@en ;
                                                       ns1:EMMO_4c8480cf_56de_41da_8699_f12a9033313a "Captures irreversible first-cycle losses that permanently reduce deliverable capacity and cannot be recovered by subsequent cycling. Must not be conflated with CoulombicEfficiency measured in later cycles."@en ;
                                                       ns1:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 "The ratio of electrical charge delivered in the first discharge to the charge consumed in the first charge of an electrochemical cell, expressed as a percentage."@en .


