                                                       ns1:EMMO_4c8480cf_56de_41da_8699_f12a9033313a "A single half-cell cannot sustain continuous current by itself; closed-circuit operation requires a counter half-cell and an external electronic path."@en ;
                                                       ns1:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 "a system comprising one electrode in contact with an ionic conductor."@en ;
