                                                       ns1:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 "The rate at which the deliverable capacity of an electrochemical cell decreases during open-circuit storage under specified conditions, in the absence of an external load."@en ;
                                                       ns1:EMMO_b6730304_cabc_4104_b415_14218466445c "Strongly temperature- and state-of-charge-dependent. Values reported without these conditions specified cannot be meaningfully compared."@en .


###  https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/electrochemistry#electrochemistry_c3f4b34a_0e2c_46f3_baab_4ebd2682d26f
